                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/newrelic/newrelic-dotnet-agent/releases/tag/v10.48.0"&gt;v10.48.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/newrelic/newrelic-dotnet-agent/compare/v10.47.2...v10.48.0"&gt;10.48.0&lt;/a&gt; (2026-01-14)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Notice&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The GPG key used to sign .NET Agent RPM packages in our YUM repo has been rotated. Please update your systems to trust the new key by downloading our &lt;a href="https://download.newrelic.com/dot_net_agent/yum/newrelic-dotnet-agent.repo" rel="nofollow"&gt;updated repository definition file&lt;/a&gt; and placing it in &lt;code&gt;/etc/yum.repos.d/&lt;/code&gt;, overwriting any existing version of that file. (&lt;a href="https://github.com/newrelic/newrelic-dotnet-agent/commit/ef5f3296ee4580d73437243f5437d86fafcac4ce"&gt;ef5f329&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;New features&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Allow users to configure process names that should not be instrumented (&lt;a href="https://github.com/newrelic/newrelic-dotnet-agent/issues/3387" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/newrelic/newrelic-dotnet-agent/pull/3387/hovercard"&gt;#3387&lt;/a&gt;) (&lt;a href="https://github.com/newrelic/newrelic-dotnet-agent/commit/8dedf324fed3559c5de8697a9728b31cf8dacf96"&gt;8dedf32&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase maximum length of &lt;code&gt;db.statement&lt;/code&gt; span attribute to 4096 bytes (&lt;a href="https://github.com/newrelic/newrelic-dotnet-agent/issues/3364" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/newrelic/newrelic-dotnet-agent/issues/3364/hovercard"&gt;#3364&lt;/a&gt;) (&lt;a href="https://github.com/newrelic/newrelic-dotnet-agent/issues/3365" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/newrelic/newrelic-dotnet-agent/pull/3365/hovercard"&gt;#3365&lt;/a&gt;) (&lt;a href="https://github.com/newrelic/newrelic-dotnet-agent/commit/bbac2f49fc5094036b97f25689b07611fefde40a"&gt;bbac2f4&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Fixes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix agent connection error when debug logging is enabled. (&lt;a href="https://github.com/newrelic/newrelic-dotnet-agent/issues/3395" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/newrelic/newrelic-dotnet-agent/pull/3395/hovercard"&gt;#3395&lt;/a&gt;) (&lt;a href="https://github.com/newrelic/newrelic-dotnet-agent/commit/82fc1b63e9194e0ed2d44e2bcca3cf3eb5dfe6cb"&gt;82fc1b6&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Restore min/max occurs properties on &lt;code&gt;distributedTracing&lt;/code&gt; config element. (&lt;a href="https://github.com/newrelic/newrelic-dotnet-agent/issues/3381" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/newrelic/newrelic-dotnet-agent/issues/3381/hovercard"&gt;#3381&lt;/a&gt;) (&lt;a href="https://github.com/newrelic/newrelic-dotnet-agent/issues/3388" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/newrelic/newrelic-dotnet-agent/pull/3388/hovercard"&gt;#3388&lt;/a&gt;) (&lt;a href="https://github.com/newrelic/newrelic-dotnet-agent/commit/2d0b89fb0561ad85bfe9a7909be7f83a88dc1067"&gt;2d0b89f&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
